summary.label:
Tiny Wage Track is a tool specially provided for workers to record working hours, workpieces, and wages. By creating a "product" to match your [hourly rate], [unit price per piece], etc., you only need to fill in [duration] or [number of pieces] for each record. Compared with similar products on the market, we provide a multi-product overlay function, that is, you can add multiple different types of work records on the same day.

The main function:
1. Multi-project system: You can create multiple projects to manage work at different stages or manage multiple part-time jobs in parallel;
2. "Product" management: Products define your hourly wage and piece-rate unit price, and different products can also be used in combination;
3. Calendar view: Every day’s records within the attendance cycle are clear at a glance, and it is also easy to view the details of each day’s records;
4. Statistics and monthly wages: Monthly work details are displayed graphically for you in terms of days summary/product category/single day details. In addition, basic wages, subsidies/deductions help you accurately record monthly wages;
5. Other thoughtful configurations: change of attendance cycle, currency type switching, theme color customization, etc.

Simple operation and easy to use.
We welcome everyone’s experience and feedback. Your support is the driving force for our continuous improvement.

